    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> \ud83d\udc3e<br>Welcome to <i>Cozy Farm</i>, a charming farm sim where you play as <strong>Cozy the Cat</strong>, a hardworking feline with a love for the land! Plant crops, raise animals, and build your dream farm\u2014all while managing your day in this somewhat realistic, heartwarming farming simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d Grow crops like corn, potatoes, grass, and turnips<br>\ud83d\udc13 Care for cows, sheep, and chickens<br>\u26cf\ufe0f Mine ore, collect wild honey, and forage for cherries<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade your tools and expand your farm<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell animal products, crops, and resources to grow your farm even bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each day, you'll need to manage your time wisely\u2014should you harvest turnips, care for your chickens, or head to the mines? It\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re tending to animals, upgrading your gear, or just enjoying the peaceful rhythm of country life, <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> is the purr-fect escape for players who love relaxing sim games with a dash of strategy and a whole lot of charm.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> \ud83d\udc3e<br>Welcome to <i>Cozy Farm</i>, a charming farm sim where you play as <strong>Cozy the Cat</strong>, a hardworking feline with a love for the land! Plant crops, raise animals, and build your dream farm\u2014all while managing your day in this somewhat realistic, heartwarming farming simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3d Grow crops like corn, potatoes, grass, and turnips<br>\ud83d\udc13 Care for cows, sheep, and chickens<br>\u26cf\ufe0f Mine ore, collect wild honey, and forage for cherries<br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Upgrade your tools and expand your farm<br>\ud83d\udcb0 Sell animal products, crops, and resources to grow your farm even bigger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each day, you'll need to manage your time wisely\u2014should you harvest turnips, care for your chickens, or head to the mines? It\u2019s up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re tending to animals, upgrading your gear, or just enjoying the peaceful rhythm of country life, <strong>Cozy Farm</strong> is the purr-fect escape for players who love relaxing sim games with a dash of strategy and a whole lot of charm.</p>",
